Well, here is a couple of ways I have used:

WARNING:  This might spoil your fun! (-;

Ah, I see.  You don't find getting disintegrated fun either.

(Maybe there should be a new tool:  A Symbolic Integrator.)

If you happen to be fortunate enough to come across a scroll of genocide,
use it to wipe out all D's (dragons).  Of course, you'll also want to have
a ring of protection from shape changers to keep chameleons from pretending
to be the kinds of dragons you are not resistant to.

If your luck is just right, the gods will grant you their protection when
you #pray.  Note that this is intrinsic protection.  Imagine walking around
with no armor and having a negative armor class!  (Well, you have to #pray
on several occasions to do this!)  This is great fun when you have a lot of
nurses around!

Note that a blast of disintegration from a dragon is the same as a wand of
death ray or a spell of finger of death, so you get an idea of just how
dangerous this dragon is.  This also means that you die instantly if you
don't happen to dodge it (i.e. there is no ring of protection from death).

